if {gameEnd} == false:
	Squirrel: Shhh… thinking.
else:
	Squirrel: The town’s buzzing in a good way. Makes reading more enjoyable.
if {skunkKey} == true and {skunkKey6} == false:
	- What do you think of Skunk's coffee?
		Squirrel: I can focus on reading there… fewer distractions than the other shops. That counts as positive, I think.
		set {skunkKey6} = true
	- Later!
if {bearOpen} == true and {bearSquirrel} == false:
	- Squirrel, this should help you focus through your next book.
		Squirrel: Finally, fuel to think properly. Thanks!
		set {bearSquirrel} = true
	- Later!
[signal arg="dialogue_end"]